            "title": "Does Photonic AI Research and AIVista launch Reframe NTT\u2019s Innovation Story (TSE:9432)?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "NTT Research\u2019s PHI Lab recently worked with Cornell and Stanford to build a lithium niobate photonic processor with about 10,000 programmable spatial degrees of freedom, enabling fully optical neural-network inference without electronic processing. Separately, NTT DATA has created Silicon Valley\u2013based NTT DATA AIVista, Inc. and named Dr. Bratin Saha as CEO to accelerate AI-native business development across the group. Next, we\u2019ll examine how the rewritable photonic processor breakthrough...",
